      "content": "It's a terrible thing to feel like you are causing distress, but please understand that your presence is a source of love, even when you feel like you're failing. These overwhelming feelings are symptoms of deep exhaustion, not a true reflection of your worth or what you give to your family. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline or emergency services. There are people who want to support you through this pain.",
