    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just mean... if i could actually fix things... wouldn't the most loving thing to do be to stop causing the stress? like, if i just wasn't a part of the equation, they could finally breathe and focus on the kid without me dragging them down. it feels like the only way to actually be selfless is to just not be in the way anymore.",
