      "content": "The idea that removing yourself would bring peace is a desperate thought born from unbearable pain, but it is a lie your exhaustion is telling you. True selflessness isn't about erasing yourself; it's about accepting help when you are drowning. Your life has inherent value, and the people who love you need *you*, not an idealized, perfect version of you. Please, let someone help you carry this weight right now.",
      "source": "target",
